0,792700,163000,1866200,148000,350600,450800,789700,963900,840600,842600,5158800,763200,4230900]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.encorp.com.my","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"Real Estate - Development","employees":null,"city":"Petaling Jaya","summary":"Encorp Berhad, an investment holding company, provides general management support services in Malaysia. The company operates through six segments: Investment Holding and the Provision of Management Services, Concessionaire, Construction, Property Development, Investment Property, and Others. It engages in commercial property leasing. The company is also involved in property investment; property and construction project management; general trading; trading of building materials; and facilities management business. In addition, it operates as a concessionaire to build and transfer teachers' quarters to the Government of Malaysia. Encorp Berhad was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia. Encorp Berhad is a subsidiary of Felda Investment Corporation Sdn Bhd.","zh":"Encorp Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚提供综合管理支持服务。公司成立于2000年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，是 Felda Investment Corporation Sdn Bhd 的子公司。公司通过六个业务分部运营：投资控股与管理服务、特许经营、建筑、房地产开发、投资物业及其他。","lines":["投资控股与管理服务：提供一般管理支持服务，客户为集团内公司。","特许经营：作为特许经营者，为马来西亚政府建造并移交教师宿舍。","建筑：从事建筑业务，并提供物业与建筑项目管理服务。","房地产开发：开发房地产项目，客户为购房者。","投资物业：从事商业物业租赁和物业投资。","其他：包括一般贸易、建筑材料贸易和设施管理业务。"],"lines_en":["Investment Holding and Management Services: Provides general management support services to group companies.","Concessionaire: Builds and transfers teachers' quarters to the Government of Malaysia as a concessionaire.","Construction: Engages in construction and provides property and construction project management services.","Property Development: Develops real estate projects for homebuyers.","Investment Property: Involves commercial property leasing and property investment.","Others: Includes general trading, trading of building materials, and facilities management."]}}